  "ans": "D",
  "exp": "Stagflation is stagnation plus inflation - weak activity and high unemployment while prices keep rising. Skewflation is a price rise confined to a few goods.",
  "conf": "official",
  "prov": "Jr. Grade of MES (Combined), 1-6 October 2025, General Studies, Q36; answer from MPSC's official final answer key, Notification No. Jr. Gr. of MES(DR)/25(1)-2025-MPSC (EXAM) dated 13 November 2025 (supersedes the 7 October 2025 provisional key)",
