  "q": "An Nginx reverse proxy fronts a Node backend that streams a generative AI completion to the browser as Server-Sent Events. Run locally the tokens appear one by one; through Nginx the client receives nothing until the model has finished, and then the whole response arrives at once. The location block is:\n\nlocation /api/chat/ {\n    proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8080;\n    proxy_http_version 1.1;\n    proxy_set_header Connection \"\";\n}\n\nWhich addition fixes the delivery?",
